WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.040
Just being at your side,

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:16.160
Gentles my hearts to the point of disbelief

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:25.570
I thought I heard the sound of your footsteps behind me,

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:35.720
I turned my head repeatedly, wishing you would appear...

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.740
...and then there you were

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:50.990
The beginning of a new love

00:00:51.310 --> 00:01:05.870
Is unknowingly, the beginning of our invisible love story

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:15.360
Hence, I shall never leave your side

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.540
I pledge to love you and only you

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:52.070
Tetsu...

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:53.470
That hurts...

00:01:56.670 --> 00:02:00.570
You're going to die soon, anyway.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:10.800
Tetsu... this is love isn't it?

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.760
Why won't you lie to me?

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:27.790
Shuji wouldn't either.

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:34.110
Even when he was terrified of me, he still said he loved me.

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:39.160
I hate it when people do that. Then I start hoping.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.070
That's why...

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.830
I said we should go back to being just classmates.

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:49.860
It's easier that way.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.890
That way, there's nothing to be sad about.

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:04.180
That way, you don't hurt each other.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.370
You think so?

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:10.520
Why are we here?

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.010
Why are we fighting?

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.060
And killing?!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.190
So we can live.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:23.160
I'm a weapon.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.470
Fighting is living.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.890
And if I live, I can love.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:35.000
And doesn't loving make me human?

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:37.400
No?

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.080
You're really still a kid.

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:46.160
A man and woman reveal their weaknesses,

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.830
those parts of their body and soul they don't show to anyone,

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.150
and rub them against each other!

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:54.680
You can't not get hurt.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:58.910
There's no way around it.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:03.900
That's how men and women are.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:11.940
Hurry and go, before I really do it.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:20.480
I'm the only one on this planet who thinks of you as a girl.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:24.660
Tetsu!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:49.680
So long. Next time I see you here will be when I die.

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:56.920
"Akemi"

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.720
Commander Chise!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.460
I'm back, Mr. Ito.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:13.270
"I'm back"?! You missed two days of maintenance!

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:16.210
And you didn't have any medicine with you!

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:21.440
Sorry. I'm a little... tired...

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.110
Commander!

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.110
Get Chise's doctor!

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:40.500
She won't regain consciousness?

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.170
Is Chise... dead?

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:44.910
This can't be!

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.810
Nice an' quiet, huh?

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:55.730
Maybe the war's over and they just haven't told us.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:06:00.330
You in such a hurry to get back to your girlfriend?

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:03.250
Atsushi!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.790
Atsushi, did you hear?

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:09.870
A big earthquake hit Hokkaido last night!

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.420
Really, Shingo?

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.660
<i>Akemi, Dad, Mom...</i>

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.660
<i>Please be alright!</i>

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:24.040
Shuji, you don't need to.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.900
I'm not hurt badly.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:30.220
What are you saying? You're still bleeding!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:36.620
But lots of people are hurt. And there's no more medicine.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.220
Where's Dad, anyway?!

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:43.560
Government worker or not, he should be helping us now!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.310
Don't worry. I'll get you looked at.

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.460
But...

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:54.820
I'm not a kid anymore! I'll handle it!

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:05.380
<i>Last night, there was another</i> <i>big earthquake.</i>

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:11.620
<i>The town I'd grown to love</i> <i>doesn't look the same.</i>

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:17.430
Mom!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.370
They said they'll see you.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.470
It's a three-hour wait, though.

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.210
Sorry about this.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.000
Don't say that. I'm your son.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.510
That's true.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:33.740
What?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:37.550
Shuji, you get more like your father, every day.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.280
You're always quiet.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:44.190
Then when there's trouble, you get all serious and say, "I'll handle it!"

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:48.610
You'll be a fine man, Shuji-dear.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:54.550
You're embarrassing me! Stop calling me "Shuji-dear"!

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:58.640
No way! You'll always be my Shuji-dear, even after you're married.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:08.210
It's getting cold. I'll go get a blanket or something.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.550
I'll pick up around the house, too.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:11.580
Thanks.

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.120
<i>I hadn't realized,</i>

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:23.560
<i>how light Mom had become,</i>

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.500
<i>or how easily she was now</i> <i>reduced to tears.</i>

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:31.940
<i>I hadn't realized a lot of things.</i>

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:39.940
Satomi?

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:41.260
Shuji!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.020
Hey. So, you're OK, kid?

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:52.390
Shuji, my sister wants to see you.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.600
Me? But why now?

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:57.790
Hurry.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:00.240
Please!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:05.840
Hurry! My sister wants to see you!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:25.890
What's... with that look...?

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:27.870
Fool...

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.930
Sorry, Shuji.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:34.160
Thanks...

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:39.530
for coming... at a time like this.

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:44.110
Dummy! Don't... talk like that! We've been friends since we were kids.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:45.570
Yeah...

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.610
I forgot... to tell you something...

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:54.320
Chise asked me to pass on to you.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:10:00.630
I can't move. Could you help me sit up?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.980
Don't try any funny stuff, just 'cause I can't move.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:06.990
Dummy.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.600
You... OK?

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:18.040
Look, here...

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:20.650
Here...

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:22.250
Uh, OK.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.250
Now, close your eyes.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:26.110
OK.

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:38.760
You fool!

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:42.170
I saw that in a comic book once.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:45.670
I never thought it'd work!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.190
Akemi--

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:48.910
I love you.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:52.570
I do.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.740
I lied about a message from Chise.

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:01.420
Here I am, a traitor to the last.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.120
She'll be mad, I bet.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.260
But, I'm dying anyway.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.060
I held back for so long.

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:15.400
She'll have to forgive me!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.370
Dummy!

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:19.390
Atsushi's off fighting for you!

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:25.160
When he told me he loved me, I told him everything.

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:31.160
I knew she would. She already likes someone.

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:35.150
Atsushi's so weird.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.940
When I told him I liked you,

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.930
but we couldn't go out,

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:47.720
he said, "Great! Then go out with me!"

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:55.170
Akemi's always liked this guy she grew up with.

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:58.200
She always watches him,

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.910
but she can never tell him how she feels.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:05.210
And even worse, her best friend likes him too.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:09.980
Akemi's such a fool, she even helps her friend.

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.590
Meanwhile, I'm just watching from the sidelines.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.790
But you told her you liked her.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.120
That's all I did.

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:27.340
Then Atsushi said,

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.880
"You don't have to love me, just let me be your boyfriend."

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:36.000
"That way, if I go off to war,"

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:39.950
"I might not be so afraid."

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:50.290
He's such a fool! Falling for a girl like me...

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:54.200
and asking me to give him courage.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:59.200
That's Akemi's swing.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.530
The whole time...

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:06.510
he stared straight into my eyes.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.610
He really is a fool.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:13.180
My chest got tight...

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.280
it hurt so much...

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.250
I cried.

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:32.440
Nice to have a girl...

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:33.000
Yup.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:34.270
I wanna kiss her.

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:37.140
Huh? Cut it out! That's my girl!

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:39.580
Give it back!

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:45.680
<i>I don't know why he thinks</i> <i>so much of me.</i>

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:50.620
<i>I have nothing to</i> <i>give him back.</i>

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:57.460
Atsushi... sorry.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:13:58.660
That's OK.

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:10.480
<i>That's why... I gave him... myself.</i>

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:13.140
<i>That day...</i>

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:15.670
<i>the enemy plane crashed.</i>

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:17.950
Akemi...

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.820
Sorry... Shuji.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:30.650
I know this sounds crazy...

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:37.330
but, I'm sorry I gave my body to Atsushi.

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:39.430
I'm sorry...

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:43.610
I wanted you to be the first...

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:47.340
I can't even show it to you now.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:54.150
It's not... the body... of a woman anymore.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:02.590
Akemi, let me see.

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.400
I'm going to look.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:07.560
Don't...

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:08.660
Shuji!

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.330
Atsushi! Give us back-up!

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:14.030
Where are you?! Back us up!

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:17.880
What am I doing here? I can't protect anyone.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:22.540
Akemi, help me...

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:24.950
I don't want to die...

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:29.000
Not here. I want to see you... Akemi!

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:31.850
I hate you...

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.030
You're beautiful, Akemi.

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:38.230
You're beautiful.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:40.460
Really pretty.

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:42.620
Liar.

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:45.900
You idiot!

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:49.130
Idiot! Idiot!

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:51.900
It's true, Akemi!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:53.940
My heart's racing!

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:59.410
Tell me... more...

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:01.720
You're beautiful, Akemi!

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:03.650
More...

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.990
You're beautiful, Akemi.

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:08.860
I'm happy.

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:14.000
Sorry... Atsushi,

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:16.630
Chise...

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:24.240
I've... loved you...

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:28.410
for years and years...

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:33.080
long before Chise ever did.

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:35.620
I always thought...

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:41.590
we'd go on together like this...

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:43.710
for years to come.

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:45.930
Akemi...

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:51.450
I was applying to a junior college in Sapporo...

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:56.440
so, when you went to Hokkaido University,

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.770
we could see each other.

00:16:59.340 --> 00:16:59.940
Yeah.

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:02.440
And then, and then...

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:08.050
Shuji? Are you still here?

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:16.630
Then I'll get my license,

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:21.400
and we can go for drives, or I can visit you.

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:25.440
We'll have fun...

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:26.970
Akemi!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.620
Shuji... are you there?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.350
Atsushi! Let's get out!

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.680
You want to see your girl again,

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:43.590
don't you?!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.120
This is no place to die!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:48.930
Let's go!

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:55.770
Shuji...know what?

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.240
I always thought...

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:03.570
we'd be together like this.

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:08.470
I always had a feeling, we'd have this moment...

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.810
And it would last forever.

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:18.920
We'll go out running again!

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:22.010
You and me!

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:25.360
Shuji...

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:28.560
I don't want to die!

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:33.500
I don't want to, Shuji!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.070
Shu...!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.410
Akemi!

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:41.310
Shu...

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:17.010
Shuji...

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:20.750
Mom,

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:25.450
I think I should apologize.

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:33.060
I haven't done anything 'till now,

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.160
And I don't know if I ever will.

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:37.400
Sorry.

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:39.740
Dummy!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:43.710
Haven't done anything? You're alive!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.570
You were born.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:04.420
Hmm, how many does that make?

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.610
Almost time, now...

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:28.020
I guess I've killed enough to go to hell.

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:35.790
Nakamura... Ryohei... sorry everyone.

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:42.260
Fuyumi, can I die yet?

00:20:56.210 --> 00:21:00.150
Sorry, Fuyumi... let me die here.

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:03.290
Forgive me.

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:09.060
Fuyumi, if I have to die...

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:12.330
I wanted to be with you.

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:22.080
Look at this room, Fuyumi.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:26.980
Doesn't it look like our place?

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:29.110
That's why I chose it.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:05.180
You guys OK?

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:12.050
It's Chise!

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:13.590
Damn her!

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:17.430
She wiped out my hometown like that.

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:21.330
There wasn't anything left!

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:23.580
So that's...

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:25.440
"Chise's Fire."

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.420
A rift opened up upon my heart

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:49.990
And I went through the night sleepless, sighing constantly

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:59.340
Before I realize, it's turned to morning

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:08.660
I want to hear your voice

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:13.250
I want to feel your warmth

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:19.460
Thoughts of you well up within me

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:25.310
And my tears begin to overflow

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:36.570
Goodbye my beloved, I am still unable to forget about you

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:46.740
Having all of this end with just a single word of goodbye

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:51.570
Fills me with sorrow

00:24:00.630 --> 00:24:03.160
Chise, our school won't be a school much longer.

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:04.930
The last festival is about to start.

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:06.260
And after that...

00:24:06.510 --> 00:24:09.870
Chise, I'll be waiting for you! There's so much I want to say!

00:24:10.210 --> 00:24:14.960
SAIKANO, Episode 10: "And Then..."
